HandsOn pi05 portable fine-tuning wrapper

This package includes byte-preserved excerpts from TsinghuaC3I/HandsOn at
be2b59aad016869e8cede1f485d64e3c2d191685 and the released dataset reader at
7ad38776d91e4e13c02dad4e6ad892e8b8a1d187.

OpenPI and LeRobot retain their Apache-2.0 license texts, notices and file headers.
HandsOn and the dataset reader retain their respective MIT notices.
See third_party/, UPSTREAM.json and the upstream repositories for provenance.
Gemma checkpoints have separate model terms. Model weights and demonstrations
are not redistributed in this Git repository.

The local wrapper adds pinned subset download, EEF52 action-head expansion,
portable paths, task configuration and train/checkpoint audits. Vendored
training code is unchanged. H100 execution has not been validated here.
